  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (B): Under GASB 34, transfers out are reported as other financing uses on the governmental fund statement of revenues, expenditures, and changes in fund balances. They appear below the operating section and reduce fund balance. The receiving debt service fund reports a corresponding other financing source.
Wrong (A): The transfer itself is not an expenditure; the actual debt service expenditure is recorded in the debt service fund.
Wrong (C): Transfers do not create liabilities between funds; they are permanent one-way resource movements.
