  choices = $EXPL$["Eliminated because all interfund balances are removed during consolidation","Disclosed only in the notes to the financial statements","Reported as a note receivable and note payable between the two funds","Reported as an internal balance between governmental and business-type activities"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): Under GASB Statement No. 34, paragraph 58, interfund balances between governmental activities and business-type activities are reported as internal balances on the government-wide statement of net position. These cross-activity balances are not eliminated because they span different activity columns.
Wrong (A): Elimination applies to interfund balances within the same activity type, not cross-activity balances.
Wrong (B): The balances are reported on the face of the statement, not merely disclosed in notes.
