  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (D): The gain or loss on disposal equals proceeds received minus the carrying amount of the parent''s investment at the disposal date under the equity method, including unamortized fair value adjustments and goodwill. This reflects the parent''s net interest in the subsidiary.
