  choices = $EXPL$["Expensed as incurred because training costs are never capitalizable","Capitalized as an implementation cost during the development stage","Deferred until the system go-live date and then amortized","Offset against subscription fees over the contract term"]$EXPL$::jsonb,
  explanation = $EXPL$Correct (A): Under ASC 350-40 and ASU 2018-15, training costs are always expensed as incurred regardless of when they occur during the project lifecycle. Training does not contribute to the development or configuration of the software and therefore does not qualify for capitalization.
